[gd_scene format=3]

; One variable: whether children with alternating operations fold batched as they fold
; pairwise. `_get_brush()` accumulates same-operation children and flushes a `BatchBoolean`
; only when the operation changes (`modules/csg/csg_shape.cpp:475-484`). The previewer folds
; pairwise, left to right. The children alternate on separate axes, so a regrouped fold moves a visible bulge or notch.

